{"title":"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Clearer_explanation_of_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Clearer explanation of Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_last_resort_(bash)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 last resort (bash)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_(Logical,_Good_Editing,_~1:00)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~1:00)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/c/9bcca20d4fc2a7f8c6339c13b6d51097fcc2551f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n=6^{n}+8^{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"100\" height=\"15\" />. Determine the remainder upon dividing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/f/43f0b5274ea12fcdbd549b5fea997ff1900b58d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_ {83}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"22\" height=\"10\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c8e6bf4d57cd6f2bb0d7d43e00f0f442f53b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Firstly, we try to find a relationship between the numbers we're provided with and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c8e6bf4d57cd6f2bb0d7d43e00f0f442f53b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />. We notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/8/a489e35824935243a757995a66af4a158d77be20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49=7^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />, and both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are greater or less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>Thus, expressing the numbers in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/c/caca0dd0c2c1b46f6a87e3bd4827c7ca4296e472.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{83} = (7-1)^{83}+(7+1)^{83}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"205\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Applying the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Binomial_Theorem\" title=\"Binomial Theorem\">Binomial Theorem</a>, half of our terms cancel out and we are left with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/5/6e549e9d208f2a7de74684ff3432f9c92d25c278.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(7^{83}+3403\\cdot7^{81}+\\cdots + 83\\cdot7)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"245\" height=\"19\" />. We realize that all of these terms are divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c8e6bf4d57cd6f2bb0d7d43e00f0f442f53b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> except the final term.\n</p><p>After some quick division, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc60431eeb404263d17ac857ee3fd2d0d0a88662.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{035}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Clearer_explanation_of_Solution_1\">Clearer explanation of Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Clearer explanation of Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The key idea is to notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/8/a489e35824935243a757995a66af4a158d77be20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49=7^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />, and we need a way to subtract large multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c8e6bf4d57cd6f2bb0d7d43e00f0f442f53b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> from both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/3/5e32e04edb457c21ffe8b673ef79c309d50b57f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^{83}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/b/5cb36239164f2df9c1ead4af451904a759220b9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^{83}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"17\" /> to make these numbers smaller.\n</p><p><br />\nWrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/d/0cd973edd399cfe07ffb7508e3770a10d625a8a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/a/4aa0fad97093347760d3c9159c7b61c97368858b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, then do binomial expansion. In both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/3/3d3cdce33b1954658fe7e11582ae5808304bb68a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(7-1)^{83}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"70\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/d/08dc3b5dbc64d7c937d764d9dc12168cfd507ad1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(7+1)^{83}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"70\" height=\"21\" />, all the terms containing a greater power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/6/026bb71c09708994ead7a4ee100a03960a87c4f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> can be neglected because they are all multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c8e6bf4d57cd6f2bb0d7d43e00f0f442f53b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />. Only the last two terms need to be considered.\n</p><p><br />\nThe last two terms for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/3/3d3cdce33b1954658fe7e11582ae5808304bb68a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(7-1)^{83}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"70\" height=\"21\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/e/2be99298e46a4cf00c18b4e06b105299e38d4ba3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$83\\times{7}\\times{(-1)^{82}}+(-1)^{83}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"199\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>The last two terms for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/d/08dc3b5dbc64d7c937d764d9dc12168cfd507ad1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(7+1)^{83}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"70\" height=\"21\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/e/99e9c9a89e79405566e1a9260989613dcfac1751.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$83\\times{7}\\times{(1)^{82}}+(1)^{83}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"170\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nAdd them together. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/1/82130f71ca4476fe5afb62604be8cc43ba94c940.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$83\\times{7}\\times{(-1)^{82}}+(-1)^{83}+83\\times{7}\\times{(1)^{82}}+(1)^{83}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"389\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/b/21bc26b896b7036fc1f3803b2326ff51984e86a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2\\times 83\\times 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/b/cab17bcf23182f0720d865b3d9c2b7e7d7293892.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=1162$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><br />\nThe remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/6/166abddc3523a5c697c7e223240e6974ec459f92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1162$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> upon division by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c8e6bf4d57cd6f2bb0d7d43e00f0f442f53b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c7f6c79f2148f0cec592c9517b40ee1b82ef22e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/6/ec653a69ce6d98fa141a70b6f471c9a77df7fbc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\phi(49) = 42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"18\" /> (see <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euler%27s_totient_function\" title=\"Euler&#39;s totient function\">Euler's totient function</a>), <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euler%27s_Totient_Theorem\" title=\"Euler&#39;s Totient Theorem\">Euler's Totient Theorem</a> tells us that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/f/c7fdb7eaad4491e24d0d94b0f40af8e6507d52fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{42} \\equiv 1 \\pmod{49}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"136\" height=\"19\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/9/509459b26bb56fba528638056aa11f48de3ffa53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{gcd}(a,49) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/7/f17e8af98946526503de743298037edd3276fd48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^{83} + 8^{83} \\equiv 6^{2(42)-1}+8^{2(42)-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"227\" height=\"17\" /> \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/9/649947561e183a82dc188c1e329432fd086e1420.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\equiv 6^{-1} + 8^{-1} \\equiv \\frac{8+6}{48}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"162\" height=\"38\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/1/481dd2b5154dfe004ae77d8d27d39894d451aa47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\equiv \\frac{14}{-1}\\equiv \\boxed{035} \\pmod{49}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"189\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Alternatively, we could have noted that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/0/020d0c0964c90fa87a294347e9f2fc52dc1476a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^b\\equiv a^{b\\pmod{\\phi{(n)}}}\\pmod n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"202\" height=\"20\" />. This way, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce24139c9d6ab040715f5f54087d605371561d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^{83}\\equiv 6^{83\\pmod {42}}\\equiv 6^{-1}\\pmod {49}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"264\" height=\"23\" />, and can finish the same way.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/a/b7a4ee9c802ab0701a5007eed50874f49fb1c003.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^{83} + 8^{83} = (6+8)(6^{82}-6^{81}8+\\ldots-8^{81}6+8^{82})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"381\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/8/9384443899646c0aab0c997a994b51e16f956c5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7|(6+8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, we only consider  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/6/016e50a61d6b0cd0d989399623dd1e8480e7fb52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^{82}-6^{81}8+\\ldots-8^{81}6+8^{82}  \\pmod{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"291\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/f/fbfbc72d586794514988ed49d2125e9f9ce706f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^{82}-6^{81}8+\\ldots-8^{81}6+8^{82} \\equiv (-1)^{82} - (-1)^{81}+ \\ldots - (-1)^1 + 1 = 83 \\equiv 6 \\pmod{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"658\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/0/9d0707c3c7f1ea273199cd39506c5f1ae6670293.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^{83} + 8^{83} \\equiv 14 \\cdot 6 \\equiv \\boxed{035} \\pmod{49}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"275\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Solution_4_last_resort_.28bash.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_last_resort_(bash)\">Solution 4 last resort (bash)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 last resort (bash)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Repeat the steps of taking modulo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c8e6bf4d57cd6f2bb0d7d43e00f0f442f53b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> after reducing the exponents over and over again until you get a residue of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/8/8f84f132840c5d5854004ec99548e9a4715f5783.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" /> namely <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/6/4766172f514a0891449b4f5eef718ecdea16d406.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35.$\" width=\"21\" height=\"12\" /> This bashing takes a lot of time but it isn’t too bad. ~peelybonehead\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_.28Logical.2C_Good_Editing.2C_.7E1:00.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_(Logical,_Good_Editing,_~1:00)\">Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~1:00)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~1:00)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/DcTxecwlsdc\">https://www.youtube.com/shorts/DcTxecwlsdc</a>\n</p><p>~Ebai\n</p><p>Note: the problem where this is linked is covered 1:00-2:00\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/-H4n-QplQew?t=792\">https://youtu.be/-H4n-QplQew?t=792</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME\" title=\"1983 AIME\">1983 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1983 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1983\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/ind